{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/hadzija7/cursor-workshop-15may/pull/5","repo":"hadzija7/cursor-workshop-15may","number":5,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Cafe planner: multiple quantities per meal with live plan controls","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nThis branch adds multi-quantity lunch planning on top of the existing single-row-per-meal model. Users can increment and decrement quantity (minimum one while the line exists; decreasing from one removes the row), remove a line from the sticky plan panel, and clear the whole plan. Totals and the shopping-list starter stay aligned with `summarizePlan(planLines)`.\n\nThe product spec is updated so shipped behavior matches the UI.\n\n## Demo\n\nScreen recording of the meal cards and **Live plan** sidebar (add, +/−, second meal, sidebar +/−, Remove).\n\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-7ce603fb-a12d-4729-86c6-ef56f293c2ec/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fcafe-planner-multi-qty-demo.mp4\"><img src=\"https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-1bca644c-938e-4dee-9080-e7fb55a612da\" alt=\"cafe-planner-multi-qty-demo.mp4\" /></a>\n\n## How to verify locally\n\n```bash\npnpm install && pnpm dev\n```\n\nUse **Add to plan**, the card steppers, and the sidebar controls; confirm total servings updates as quantities change.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-7ce603fb-a12d-4729-86c6-ef56f293c2ec\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-7ce603fb-a12d-4729-86c6-ef56f293c2ec\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n","authorType":"User","additions":197,"deletions":53,"changedFiles":6,"files":[{"path":"specs/meal-planner.md","additions":9,"deletions":8},{"path":"src/components/cafe-planner.tsx","additions":33,"deletions":1},{"path":"src/components/meal-card.tsx","additions":59,"deletions":16},{"path":"src/components/meal-grid.tsx","additions":25,"deletions":10},{"path":"src/components/plan-summary.tsx","additions":70,"deletions":17},{"path":"src/lib/plan.ts","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"baseSha":"e18e93f08a758263d742de5ee64f5cf208e3967e","template":null}